<p>
    Min Bet, Max Bet and Max Per Match for each product (Sport type) are defined here.
</p>
<ul>
    <li>Min Bet: the minimum stake allowed on a bet. "&#62;&#61; X" means Input must be greater
        than or equal to X.</li>
    <li>Max Bet: the maximum stake allowed on a bet. "&#60;&#61; X" means Input must be less than
        or equal to X.</li>
    <li>Max Per Match: the maximum stake allowed on a match. "&#60;&#61; X" means Input must be
        less than or equal to X.</li>
    <li>Max Per Ball: the maximum stake allowed on a ball. "&#60;&#61; X" means Input must be
        less than or equal to X.</li>
</ul>
<p>
    <span class="note">Note:</span> decimal numbers are not allowed. For instance, 100.25
    is an invalid input.
</p>